# Assets that are NOT screenshots and NOT confirmed brand material.
#
# `ep-logo.png` ended up here: it is a glossy "EP" mark on an opaque dark
# background, which does not match FullPOS Cloud / FULLTECH, SRL branding.
#
# Two reasons it is not used yet:
#   1. It is not FullPOS branding, so putting it on a public ad would misrepresent
#      the product (AGENTS.md: do not invent brand material).
#   2. Its background is opaque, so composited on the blue intro card it would look
#      like a dark rectangle rather than a logo mark.
#
# To use it: save a transparent PNG (or tell the agent to blend it), then move it to
# `../logo/` and re-run `--compose-only` (free - no RunPod jobs are created).
